# The control for Headliner Scarlett's "creatures target player controls can't block": aimed at Bot1 itself, it leaves Bot2's Ornithopter free to block her, and the 0/2 blocker dies to her 3 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Sol Ring
Headliner Scarlett
Mountain x5
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Headliner Scarlett.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Target(Bot1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Headliner Scarlett)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Headliner Scarlett)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
